/// The single-element indexing Contract: `receiver[key]` resolves through a conformance to Indexable<Key> and designates the
/// referent of the reference the selected requirement returns (SPEC 4.7.1).
///
/// The standard Array, fixed-array and Slice indexing remains compiler-provided (STATUS); user Types conform explicitly
/// (SPEC 4.7.1, 22.1).
public contract Indexable<Key>
    associate Element

    /// Lends the element selected by `key` for reads and shared borrows.
    ///
    /// - return: A shared reference to the element that depends on `self`; `receiver[key]` designates its referent.
    /// - abort: `key` selects no element.
    func index(self: ref/Self, key: ref/Key) -> ref/Element during self

/// The exclusive indexing Contract: updates and exclusive borrows of `receiver[key]` select `indexUniq`.
///
/// Both requirements belong to one conformance and must return a reference to the same element for the same key.
public contract UniqIndexable<Key>: Indexable<Key>
    /// Lends the element selected by `key` for updates and exclusive borrows.
    ///
    /// - return: An exclusive reference to the element that depends on `self`.
    /// - abort: `key` selects no element.
    func indexUniq(self: uniq/Self, key: ref/Key) -> uniq/Element during self
